<title>Mexico's cartel violence: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mexico/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mexico-2026-10-15T20:27:08.435Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 20:27:08 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Cartel gangs are kidnapping local officials in Mexico to force the release of detained members, while the defense minister says cartels are using drones to scout U.S. border agents and map smuggling routes. The U.S. Treasury has sanctioned four individuals and eleven entities tied to a cartel-controlled horse-racing and business network that includes links to New Mexico. Mexico has ordered social-media firms to remove content inciting violence within a month, and disinformation campaigns linked to a TV mogul are targeting minorities. 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxPR01KYUphZnRkb1BYc2NERUdWakRfeFZBenJqV2FnLTk0M2VCbDlMS05JMDUzVXk5dzFjalphYzhOek85U1plMkphWFF0cmF6eFBJQ2Q3S2NrUGhaZ2pCWmtwOEJJUkYyb3hDaG9VM0lpZUN2eWtBMW1VZ2F1ak80M2phYUVuODYyeGZuSjVqdmtZRnNLN2J5aHkyNUlWd0ozc3pOakFfdmhKZDdYcHFva3o1NmJpdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTFBuR3R3SFZReE52WVpId0NHc015TnVwdGwySy05d1A3N01zUjhYYTJIUGlwbzQ5UWtzZGRmN2c3TGtPX2l5R3lLUWVTNUlDRUo2MGNKMTlxZEM4Wkc4QXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxPOXhDQ3dIbkpmRndpS3NsTFF4SDdIb3Y4QVh2dXEwZDQzME1jRHY4cHlXVmdEV2h3anRMRXB6Uld5YWt0SGxFeklpTl9xdGk1ODJIbUFaYmc4R1M2cWZ1dHNITVVRZzI1N0JCbG43UW83QXJVYjQ5anRnbzFsYTBjcFNTdWt0YWtQeGFJRGNGSTkwUjFvdDJJVVJ4QkRUSkQ4QmdJUG56UC1BWjBIaVk5dmdpTktZcThm?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxPeFRQNU05cEY3UkpoRHh2NU9vQTRIU29HaWRjZXVONjFLVzU2Rkx6eUctUEpyT2FaRUYxcTROMTh1Ym1nLUdoRnVFcHBzSGM3V3JHQldoaTc3WllBYUJLVXBGTnlMR0RvWm8wNjdLYWFlbno2S0dobjRrRzN4Tm1JWTJ6bzNBdVdLay1OeGNSd2JHUW45QUNCaWFPb2RLaHZJ?oc=5&quot;&gt;InSight Crime&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;htt